FULL DESCRIPTION (max 4000 characters)
--------------------------------------
Stock Management System is a complete inventory, billing and supplier management app for small shops, canteens and stores. It works fully offline: your records stay on your own device, with no account and no internet connection needed.

BILLING
• Create bills quickly and record cash, UPI, card, loan and swipe sales
• Stock is sold oldest-first, so every bill follows your real purchase entries
• Track pending loan and swipe payments by customer and mark them paid on the day they are settled
• Choose your bill print size and share or print bills as PDF

STOCK AND RATE LIST
• Live rate list with purchase rate, profit percentage and selling rate for every item
• Stock value at a glance
• Damage and write-off records
• Opening stock import from CSV

SUPPLIERS, QUOTATIONS AND PURCHASES
• Keep a record for every supplier: contact details, purchases, payments and dues
• Record supplier quotations for each quotation period, by rate or by discount percentage
• Compare suppliers side by side and see who is cheapest for each item
• Log purchases against the recommended supplier; items bought on a discount keep their MRP and discount percentage
• Import quotations and purchases from CSV files

REPORTS AND ACCOUNTS
• Item-wise sales report, profit report and monthly profit
• Cashbook with separate cash and bank balances, receipts (RV) and payments (PV), day view and daily summary
• Monthly summary ledger
• Dead stock register with repair history

YOUR DATA, YOUR CONTROL
• Export reports and records to Excel, PDF or CSV
• Backup and restore your complete data
• No ads, no tracking, no data sent anywhere
• Light and dark mode

Built for everyday shop and canteen work: simple screens and fast entry.

